 - **[React](https://react.dev/)**: Used for UI components.
 - **[Tailwind CSS](https://tailwindcss.com/)**: For styling the application.
 - **[Astro DB](https://docs.astro.build/en/guides/database/)**: Powers the comments feature, using a libSQL-compatible database.
+
+## WebMCP tools
+
+The sign-in and sign-up forms are exposed to AI agents through the
+[WebMCP](https://webmachinelearning.github.io/webmcp/) declarative API. Each
+`<form>` carries `toolname` / `tooldescription` attributes, so a WebMCP-capable
+browser lists it as a tool, builds the input schema from the form controls, and
+routes the submission result back to the agent via `SubmitEvent.respondWith()`.
+
+| Tool      | Page      | Agent may submit on its own? |
+| --------- | --------- | ---------------------------- |
+| `sign-in` | `/signin` | Yes (`toolautosubmit`)       |
+| `sign-up` | `/signup` | No, the user clicks **Sign Up** after reviewing |
+
+Trying it out requires Chromium 146.0.7672.0 or newer with
+`chrome://flags/#enable-webmcp-testing` enabled and a secure context. Other
+browsers ignore the attributes and the forms behave as usual. The shared helpers
+live in `src/utils/webmcp.ts`.
